WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
Use these questions to open
a working discussion.

00:00:02.733 --> 00:00:05.680
Where does the team lose
the most time today?

00:00:05.707 --> 00:00:08.800
Which payment behavior
can the domain owner define clearly?

00:00:08.976 --> 00:00:12.560
What prevents a second engineer
from repeating the same test?

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.440
Who can fund and support
the missing foundation?

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.440
The next step is a workflow
assessment with quality assurance,

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.040
development and platform
leads. Agree one bounded

00:00:23.107 --> 00:00:26.800
pilot and its evidence before
promising an organization-wide rollout.
